WARNING: TO BUILD AND USE THIS MOD, YOU WILL NEED THE ALLIUM VERSION OF THE MOD FROM https://github.com/minecraftbossdj/Allium-cobalt-0.9.5/releases/tag/cobalt-0.9.5

examples:

lua:
local AlliumEvents = require("com.awesoft.alliumjs.AlliumEvents")

AlliumEvents.KUBEJS_EVENT:register(script, function(name, obj)
	print("event name: "..name)
end)

js:

Allium.fireEvent("testEvent","yoo")

note that obj can be ANYTHING (the second arguement), just not sure what javascript and lua can both see...
